# Deliberately does NOT force line-ending normalisation: mobile/main.dart (now
# driver_app/main.dart) is stored with CRLF today and a blanket "eol=lf" would rewrite the
# whole file. Normalise it in the dedicated formatting commit planned for Phase 1.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.sh   text eol=lf

# Keep GitHub language statistics and diffs useful
docs/history/** linguist-documentation
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
